# Promote is a skill, not a copy-paste

If the user says **promote**, **publish to leadership**, or **make leadership match preview**,
read `.cursor/skills/promoting-preview/SKILL.md` and run `python3 scripts/promote_preview.py`.
Do not overwrite `site/index.html` with the preview page.
